        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-28-t1917-051-on-the-theory-of-transformatio-audit-thompson1917-t1917-051-5>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-28-t1917-051-on-the-theory-of-transformatio-audit-thompson1917-t1917-051-6>,
